{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "a5a7826eca18f19056968b74c8cc869f05a84bd1710e624540b19bcb384fa9c8", "ja": "胸騒ぎのファクター", "zh": "忐忑不安的Factor", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "451db1733d3f33009b6d903eec58da126f40bb2217ec6cf5105c36913054e6c4", "ja": "台本の読み合わせ中、未来の演技に違和感が\r\nあった琴葉は、セリフに感情が乗っていない\r\n事を指摘するが、未来は中々理解できない。\r\n未来には役と向き合う時間が必要だと考えた\r\n琴葉は、個人練習を提案する。", "zh": "对台词时，未来的演技让琴叶觉得哪里不对，\n她指出未来的台词没有投入感情，但未来\n却不太能理解。琴叶认为未来需要一些时间\n来揣摩角色，便提议进行个人练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8560166d1ab1fb32b093cb55f2a26f6f28138a928bca8c20f8bfb0d3ed40ed52", "ja": "（今日は『階のスターエレメンツ』の台本読み合わせ。\n3人は、ちょうど序盤の山場を練習中だが……）", "zh": "（今天是《阶梯上的Star Elements》对台词的日子，\n三人正在练习开头的精采片段……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "ab759433c3339e447ff14b82c3816398c240059bb4e33e516a7553629cc6abca", "ja": "『あなた達、来週の最終選考、辞退しなさい。\nお遊びで参加されると、時間のムダだから』", "zh": "『你们放弃下周的最终审查吧。\n如果抱着玩玩的心态参加，只是浪费时间而已。』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "9dd2c918386dc01668611aa2b27337fa92e820294805795ef682a45cf1b359f0", "ja": "『っ！　お、お遊びなんかじゃ……！』", "zh": "『唔！我、我才不是玩玩……！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "b80770595d3a7a0513a5f2b0c458773e833e23e9b8a02cf7377d091f48f5d5f9", "ja": "『違うとでも？　……実力も、覚悟もないくせに。\nアイドルになりたいなんて、聞いて呆れる』", "zh": "『不是吗？……你们明明没有实力也没有觉悟，\n还说想当偶像，我真是听不下去了。』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "4cf41ba6dc5ddc33baf6eaed0d308dc00d4a053bb404a708dcdde32b8db75e9c", "ja": "『ば……馬鹿にしないでっ！　たしかに、\nあなたの方が歌は上手かったかもしれないけど……』", "zh": "『别、别瞧不起我！\n虽然你唱歌的确是唱得比较好……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "aefd55cabe1ea1c50e76f2c464a4fc4825538392fa697a2f0f0c30d79034f2ff", "ja": "『だからって、遊びでやってるわけじゃない！\n私は絶対に勝ち残って、アイドルになってみせる！』", "zh": "『但我也不是抱着玩玩的心态！\n我一定会赢到最后，当上偶像给你看！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "f4d90235cfcc3625d02333cbf4127f9957b0c6a027cb66ce8572cd4a5f77bfa5", "ja": "うーん……。\nちょっと、足りないかも……？", "zh": "该怎么说呢……\n好像少了点什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "705d14a80af04fe53b542034be06543d94243b9193b6cd1ca4fe5586cca56644", "ja": "あれ？　私、どこか間違えちゃいました？", "zh": "咦？我有什么地方错了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "9b74f406cb991fc77ee59906c3d866fd4ff8968f389497a867c694c54b0bc0df", "ja": "ううん、セリフは間違ってなかったんだけど。\n想像より、迫力がないかなぁと思って。", "zh": "不是的，台词没说错，\n但似乎没有想像中那么有魄力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "35bf1d565da03b2ac8c7e6ace9c08b8ba084581a6c4a3f23e6379cb5b68349e8", "ja": "迫力？　もっと、バーン！って\nやったほうがいいってことかな。", "zh": "魄力？\n意思是应该要更「砰！」一点吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "50a332bdcb359b10e38237a5f4f6623ccabbd56096d4960e4ae00d00d705a6ee", "ja": "バーン！じゃ全然わからないぞ、未来……。", "zh": "你说「砰！」大家可听不懂啊，未来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "4162db33935bfe365f3c96f9f998e17b759c30f83d41110e408b921797719a2b", "ja": "思いきり、って意味ではそうなのかも。このシーン、\n未来は、怒りをぶつけたほうがいいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "如果是使尽全力的意思，那或许没错。\n我觉得在这一幕，未来应该把愤怒都发泄出来会比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "8f42e41eb118f35c1da8409661133933088fe51070c15609ed5f832af146795e", "ja": "怒りって……\nけ、ケンカしちゃうってことですか！？", "zh": "愤怒……\n是、是要吵架吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "b77c0e52285837c988d100e3af48625559b5c754e997a3874d346802c753b279", "ja": "そう。だって私の役は、ふたりに対してひどいこと……\nプライドを傷つけるような言葉を、言ったでしょ。", "zh": "没错，毕竟我演的角色对你们俩说话很难听……\n说了伤害你们自尊的话嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "1ff89d27fb6f36aa5106ddbb6f11ac71e9541c9626e0744fb4ff65ee482995de", "ja": "だったらふたりの反発も、\nそれだけ大きくなるのが自然な反応だと思うの。", "zh": "所以我认为你们俩的反驳要更激动一点，\n这样的反应感觉比较自然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "0528fdc7a2506df9face9a12d8a7fe170404d9987b4c01ee9f3a3d360b25501b", "ja": "私の言ったことを、許せないって本気で思うなら。\n倒すつもりで、かかってくるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "既然打从心底觉得无法接受我说的那些话，\n那就该用想打败我的心态全力反驳才是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "eee1dd646617062640e29ef11b865061c9c08c7dcc37d0ecf490635e8ed8e3d2", "ja": "倒すって……わ、私が、琴葉ちゃんを！？", "zh": "打败……我、我要打败琴叶吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "eed4ff8c0eb219a3fa159339c9bebef7e45ae84bb21cb949c39b66179f643700", "ja": "そうだよ。だって、この3人はライバルなんだもの。\n……そういう気持ち、未来にはわからない？", "zh": "没错，因为这三个角色是竞争对手啊。\n……未来不懂这种感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "b275045a18bf18c9f149fdda770a2a0c62d92374edb117a09f9ffd48048fcc07", "ja": "うう～ん……。\n急に言われても、琴葉ちゃんは琴葉ちゃんだし……。", "zh": "唔唔……\n就算突然跟我这么说，但琴叶就是琴叶呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "1da17994513f5bfc5cacf06603a2ff2725d95e676673698b293a961fc2a1f9f1", "ja": "（3人とも、少し行き詰ってきたみたいだな……）", "zh": "（她们三人似乎遇到瓶颈了呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1021_p", "source_sha256": "96343c7b65197d524d555b6a55695b011d601bded63c2147f5754c6d6bd7c680", "ja": "みんな、そろそろ休憩しないか？\nもう、かなりぶっ続けでやってるだろう。", "zh": "大家要不要先休息一下？\n刚刚已经练习满长一段时间了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "d0c7ab6e4f07da452f883c34844d3f41958f1bda34209be7db7800b1401c5168", "ja": "あっ……そうですね、{$P$}。\nそれじゃあふたりとも、すこし休憩しよう。", "zh": "啊……说得也是，{$P$}。\n那两位，我们先休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "82c43706add3b51d4a67272a82d497d8036bbdf9e54f54cbce31a3a3abc40686", "ja": "は～い！　うう、がんばってマジメな顔してたら、\nオデコが疲れてきちゃったよ～。", "zh": "好的～！呜呜，努力摆出严肃的表情，\n额头好累喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "531576b7ddd2b59c8e94a9f6764dd0fa67287edbe90628edc96ad45a1c0b855a", "ja": "オデコ？　なんで？", "zh": "额头？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "5ddbdb27927b3930fd1a91c07c85f39a8dc243090f0b7c8192fbfdae37e75600", "ja": "マジメな顔すると、ここにシワが寄るでしょ。\n静香ちゃんとか、よくこうなってるよ。ギュ～って。", "zh": "因为摆出严肃的表情时，这边不是会皱起来吗？\n小静也常常这样，眉头皱得紧紧的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "fd44dc19cde1ad9da2a939c05091a6f46c8c56f72b746a56c9679df4369c1d62", "ja": "あははははっ！　み、未来ちゃん。\nそれ、マジメじゃなくて面白い顔だよ～！", "zh": "哈哈哈哈！\n未、未来，那不是严肃的表情，是鬼脸才对啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "de8d025adb8c70a0d6648e5b6cf1e05557a9a3e7c96959081572faf924b49de3", "ja": "その話、静香に聞かせたら怒るだろうな……。", "zh": "刚刚那些要是被静香听到，她应该会生气吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1028_014mir", "source_sha256": "bd30c3400eb224a0d788a44017b0938c6333b7d66bc9c7f5ca28b838670380e1", "ja": "ええっ！？　静香ちゃんには言っちゃダメですよ、\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "咦咦！？\n{$P$}先生，不可以跟小静说喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1029_017kth", "source_sha256": "281fb6b2708a7cda2ab67b3c2e58e53f7d41106680cb080ba4497bc4ef8dab7d", "ja": "未来は、いつも楽しそうだよね。\n練習中も、ずっと楽しそうだったけど……。", "zh": "未来看起来总是很开心呢，\n练习时也一直很开心的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "b1a8b3a855a3d43541e78659f16f0e00492114b0bf675b5ed5ba6678581f858d", "ja": "うん、すっごく楽しい！　みんなと練習するの大好き♪\n琴葉ちゃんと可奈も、そうでしょ？", "zh": "嗯，我很开心！我最喜欢和大家一起练习了♪\n琴叶和可奈也是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "eb0a5211725150ed60c066d8e4be8d7c0712582acbda7531f68f51969ce48a2a", "ja": "私は……楽しいっていうより、『難しい』かなぁ？\n普段の私とは全然違うし、裏表がある役だから……。", "zh": "我……与其说开心，更多的是觉得『好难』吧～？\n因为这个角色表里不一，和平常的我完全不同……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "c22b894eebe8860ff791bd6b6080c61576e3fd9c22068546c8e9209a492a8cc0", "ja": "そっか～。\n可奈の役、大変そうだもんね。", "zh": "这样啊～\n可奈的角色演起来感觉很辛苦呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1034_p", "source_sha256": "11882ce0a8c13ef0c085dec0b91c612c612502ac0fc2e420e3d72f0349fad8c5", "ja": "（その後も、練習はある意味、和やかに進んだが……\n最後になって、琴葉から提案があった）", "zh": "（之后的练习在某种程度上算是平顺度过了……\n但琴叶在最后提出了一个提案。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1035_017kth", "source_sha256": "1a984f74d44c52fd38c2c93ddb4df2cceba36b35317166a26d2528659b9274fb", "ja": "ねえ、未来。相談なんだけど……。\n明日は、ひとりで台本を読み込んでみない？", "zh": "话说，未来，我想跟你商量一件事……\n你明天要不要试试一个人深入研读剧本？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "2322f58285e5bd3b5d7da6d0cfd8c7c75afb493d811898385edb6bdc88e10df2", "ja": "ひとりって……私、ひとりで？\n琴葉ちゃんと可奈は？", "zh": "一个人是指……我一个人吗？\n那琴叶和可奈呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1037_017kth", "source_sha256": "faa5d52d48e9539cff5cc42d406462c31b172098d788f44b9a65be5c8ec0bdd6", "ja": "私は、可奈ちゃんの練習を見てあげようかと……。\n裏表のある役のアプローチに、悩んでるみたいだし。", "zh": "我打算旁观可奈练习，给她建议……\n因为她似乎也在烦恼如何驾驭表里不一的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "9115e2acb96669df2fd018ed4bc5db90eeadb09ca759d98529a8893b773eed3d", "ja": "ええっ！？\n琴葉さん、いいんですか！", "zh": "咦咦！？\n琴叶，真的可以麻烦你吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1039_017kth", "source_sha256": "08b2f0609c3817c082b2436e69ae194977cc368b0555a95bcc00440f657eeab3", "ja": "もちろん。役柄への理解はできているみたいだから……\nあとは可奈ちゃんが、どんな風にしたいかだと思う。", "zh": "当然可以，因为可奈你似乎已经理解了这个角色……\n剩下的问题就是你想怎么诠释了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1040_014mir", "source_sha256": "2e9e71b70db3bb8a888205d747e0a872f34185215f293f228e3a51526ed6cf81", "ja": "ええ～、私もいっしょに練習したいのに～！\nなんで私だけダメなの、琴葉ちゃん！", "zh": "咦咦～我也想一起练习呀～！\n琴叶，为什么只有我不能一起练习呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1041_017kth", "source_sha256": "2af243a43c80dea5a31aff8f2a6a33aac2171e729e583c17fafb071416e0da66", "ja": "厳しいことを言うようだけど。今の未来は、\nもっと役柄への理解を深めたほうがいいと思うの。", "zh": "这样说可能会有点严厉，\n但我认为未来你现阶段应该先加深对角色的理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1042_017kth", "source_sha256": "b90ebb009e39a4a92b1231ad5e0ce7f7a632b9f1888c747ff049016aedcf4f7b", "ja": "そのためにも、まずはじっくり役と向き合ったり、\n掘り下げて考えたりする時間が必要じゃないかな？", "zh": "为了做到这一点，\n应该要先把时间用在揣摩角色和深入思考上吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1043_014mir", "source_sha256": "0268479c40809070ed9488f860340e1fc8cffc152df2b3dd2517ca2353065f23", "ja": "でもでも、ひとりで練習なんて寂しいよ～！\n{$P$}さん、何か言ってください！", "zh": "但是但是～一个人练习好寂寞喔～！\n{$P$}先生，你也帮我说说话嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1044_p", "source_sha256": "d8f96d769841d4bb3f71178937023272f7f84c8ae7acdf3d9c39f7d0eaa18f3f", "ja": "そうだな……。\n琴葉の言うことも、一理あると思う。", "zh": "这个嘛……\n我觉得琴叶说的也有道理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1045_p", "source_sha256": "dfb2ed52ec8769ff46cfbc4ddceb84efb94833142e36aa22adc44f3fbd391132", "ja": "今のまま漠然と練習を続けるより、未来自身がまず、\n自分の役をしっかり作り上げるべきなんじゃないか？", "zh": "与其维持现状、马虎地继续练习，\n我想未来你更该先好好塑造出自己的角色吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1046_014mir", "source_sha256": "ebd110f4779b5668a5d26d534756ea66e794e745a7f05c622e92b7c78f7766e5", "ja": "ええ～！　{$P$}さんまで～！？", "zh": "咦咦～！连{$P$}先生都这么说～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1047_014mir", "source_sha256": "76bdb0e403e1ab00de420b7904c8215efc4db6c98341d7b59da1410d4f0d80a7", "ja": "うう、わかりました。ふたりがそこまで言うなら、\n明日から、ひとりで練習します……。", "zh": "呜呜，我知道了。既然你们两个都这样说了，\n那我明天就开始一个人练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1048_014mir", "source_sha256": "5eab5f41cb869034e6e14cbd3e757e229d1db5084f5a2f24e305b9ff474ad3b1", "ja": "{$P$}さん、琴葉ちゃん、可奈。\nお疲れさまでした……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生、琴叶、可奈，\n大家辛苦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1049_036kan", "source_sha256": "e70540eb5745f5d91bf5f7db62a51e46efb4ff39dc034cdff1dfe3e3162f92f2", "ja": "あっ、未来ちゃん！？\nわ、私もいっしょに帰るよ～！", "zh": "啊，未来！？\n我、我也要跟你一起回去～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1050_017kth", "source_sha256": "dd30f9c61f100d4f5726fdd4d9c9e0b16ef60d51997eed977e905d3c5b93f92b", "ja": "未来……すみません、{$P$}。\nいきなり、厳しくしすぎたでしょうか？", "zh": "未来……对不起，{$P$}。\n我是不是一下子说得太严厉了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1051_p", "source_sha256": "c50dd0be502a31a191d3acbcc4cd124240327899a0c0abd8175c6a59b490cf8a", "ja": "いや、琴葉が言わなかったら、俺が言ってたんじゃ\nないかな……。ありがとう。", "zh": "不，要是琴叶你没说的话，\n我应该也会提出来吧……谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1052_p", "source_sha256": "5af40d2682caf431abb1c7f82829b36d2e903d64525f500f927c0ae90728ad63", "ja": "3人のドラマを、より良いものにするためだ。\n未来もきっと、わかってくれるさ。", "zh": "这是为了让你们三人把电视剧演得更好，\n未来一定也会懂的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1053_017kth", "source_sha256": "8d75c15c1cd116e1522a9ca6c9554a69488eefbe483b38f922f78bde2217c6ed", "ja": "はい。……この物語を演じるためには、私たちも、\nお互いをライバルだと思う必要があると思うんです。", "zh": "嗯……为了演出这个故事，\n我想我们也必须把彼此视为竞争对手才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1054_017kth", "source_sha256": "3f6a00bf304b7a0d6519212729b122d9edee7d6b44a1669c1df69c50af649b7c", "ja": "ドラマの中の候補生と同じように……とまでは\n言いませんけど……。", "zh": "但我不会要求……\n要和电视剧里的候补生一样就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0083_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_02_1055_p", "source_sha256": "d01ae2932009b1a811e24b9ebd056a2c845585e465928d629100b8a850fa90eb", "ja": "（琴葉は、全体の事を考えている。……後は未来が、\n変に落ち込んだりしなければいいんだけど）", "zh": "（琴叶思考的是整体面的问题……\n接下来只希望未来别因想太多而过度沮丧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
